        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana EXTROD, Flush Door Bolt Extension Rods</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThreaded rod are used with <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\"><b>Deltana Extension Flush Bolts</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/standard-store-front-door-flush-bolt-global-th1100-fb1\"><b>Aluminum Door Extension Flush Bolts</b></a> or any others that use a 1/4-20 threaded rod between the flip lever and door bolt. Available in 3 different lengths of 10-1/2\", 17-7/8\" or 24\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-EXTROD.gif?v=1704354739\" width=\"600\" height=\"97\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Flush Door Bolt Extension Rod Specifications\">\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana EXTROD Flush Door Bolt Extension Rod:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Available Length: 10-1/2\", 17-7/8\" or 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Diameter: 1/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Threads per Inch: 20 </li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EXTROD.pdf?v=1704262244\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana EXTROD Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
